    "text": "The backend removes the transaction PIN before sending the request to Reloadly. A provider operation is written as `PENDING` before the external request and updated to `SUBMITTED` or `FAILED`. `SUBMITTED` does not mean settled. Wallet debit and settlement must be completed by a verified status/reconciliation flow before this can be production-ready."
